# Force text handling + text diffs for source files. Some legitimately contain a NUL
# byte (e.g. MirrorView uses "\0" as an unambiguous branch/cwd join separator), which
# makes git auto-detect the file as binary — hiding line diffs/blame and reporting
# commits as "Bin … bytes / 0 insertions". `text` normalizes EOLs; `diff` forces git to
# diff them as text despite the NUL.
*.ts   text diff
*.tsx  text diff
*.js   text diff
*.jsx  text diff
*.go   text diff
*.css  text diff
*.html text diff
*.json text diff
*.md   text diff
*.yml  text diff
*.yaml text diff
# 図（drawio）は圧縮せず素の XML でコミットしているので、差分もテキストで読める。
*.drawio text diff
